@DocuMind.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5082

### Health check
GET {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### List all documents
GET {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents

### Ingest a document
POST {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/ingest
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

### Query documents
POST {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the main contribution of this paper?",
  "topK": 5
}

### List conversations
GET {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/conversations

### Delete all documents
DELETE {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents
